dn20:20.9 starts: And ten Brahmā sovereigns, each the lord of
dn20:20.10 starts: and in their midst has come
# superseded: dn20:20.11 starts: Hārita Brahmā
# superseded: dn20:20.12 starts: surrounded by his retinue.”
dn20:22.5 starts: “Māra’s army has approached.
dn20:22.6 starts: Detect them, monks!”
dn20:22.7 starts: Listening to the Awakened One’s instruction,
dn20:22.8 starts: they made an ardent effort.
dn20:22.9 starts: The army retreated from those without passion,
dn20:22.10 starts: without raising even a hair on their bodies.
